  "abstract": "Seed-robustness check of our best Fourier LN + learnable \u03b3[t] config with a new BASE_SEED (3407\u21923407/3408/3409). Confirms stability beyond seed 42 and exports \u03b3 profiles and per-condition MAEs.",
